  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Poke sushi bowl brings island inspired freshness to your table, combining tender cubes of tuna with creamy avocado, crisp cucumber, and bright scallions. A drizzle of tamari, sesame oil, and a touch of honey creates a balanced mix of savory and gentle sweetness. Served over fluffy sushi rice, every bite delivers a lively contrast of textures and flavors. Quick to prepare and easy to customize with chili flakes or fresh ginger, this vibrant bowl is perfect for a light lunch or a relaxed, feel good dinner.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-poke-sushi-bowl\">Why You’ll Love This poke sushi bowl</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-poke-sushi-bowl\">How to Make Poke Sushi Bowl</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-poke-sushi-bowl\">Pro Tips for Making poke sushi bowl</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-poke-sushi-bowl\">How to Serve this poke sushi bowl</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-poke-sushi-bowl\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This poke sushi bowl</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Fresh ingredients that burst with flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable to suit your taste preferences.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthy and satisfying meal option.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-10276\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"10276\" data-servings=\"2\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wpr