    "1 tsp rice vinegar (for a touch of tang)",
    "1 tsp honey (to balance the flavors)",
    "1 each avocado (sliced for creaminess)",
    "1/2 each cucumber (sliced for crunch)",
    "2 each green onions (chopped for freshness)",
    "1 sheet nori (cut into strips for garnish)",
    "1 tbsp sesame seeds (for added texture)",
    "to taste pickled ginger (for a zesty kick)"
  ],
